```

The function must inspect every reading and reject the first one whose `kind` differs from `expected_kind`. Otherwise, it must return one `Reading` whose kind is `expected_kind` and whose value is the checked sum of all values. Return `Overflow` instead of wrapping or saturating. An empty slice produces value zero. Preserve input order while validating so the reported mismatch is deterministic. Do not mutate or retain aliases to the input. Empty kind strings are valid when they match exactly.

